  "why": "Young Ladies Don't Play Fighting Games, a 12 episode summer 2026 TV run airing 2026-07-07 to 2026-09-22 and still on air at labelling time. AniZip 16000 is the same run: SAME_AS ids to mal:46488 and anilist:128757, the same episodeCount of 12, and a first episode dated 2026-07-07, the run's own start date. The Crunchyroll season GT00362362-GS00362363 is the same run: it maps SAME_AS onto all four members and its 10 episodes fall on exactly AniZip's Tuesdays from 2026-07-07 to 2026-09-08 with the same titles, so it is the aired part of the cour and not a wider season (10 is fewer than 12). The JustWatch season 271657-282883 is the same run: it maps SAME_AS onto all four members and onto anizip:16000 and repeats nine of the same titles in order. The bare Crunchyroll series GT00362362 has no dates, count or episodes of its own, and Kitsu records it as a PART_OF container for this run, so it holds the run. AniZip episodes 1 to 10 pair with the Crunchyroll ones on identical broadcast days and titles, from I'm Done with Fighting Games to But I Did Think It, and AniZip episodes 1 to 9 pair with Kitsu's, which carry the same nine titles although Kitsu publishes no dates. Crunchyroll episodes 1 to 9 pair with the JustWatch ones on those same titles. JustWatch episode 10 is titled Sou Omottan da, the romanised Japanese rather than But I Did Think It, and JustWatch has no dates, so that position is left unpaired, as are AniZip's untitled episodes 11 and 12 (2026-09-15 and 2026-09-22) and Kitsu's untitled 10 to 12."
